  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Hydrogen Summit 2023 &#x2013; Hosting green hydrogen delegations (CERF23NL4O)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CERF is collaborating on the government level in order to contribute to the development of the green hydrogen sector in several of the partner countries.The World Hydrogen Summit &amp; Exhibition (WHS) in Rotterdam, is a yearly event that brings together green hydrogen players from all over the world. It contributes to collaboration between countries, policy development, innovation and increased investment and business opportunities.CERF invited and hosted governmental delegations from Algeria, Colombia, Egypt, India, Morocco and South Africa. Networking and matchmaking events where offered, as well as round tables, all in close collaboration with the International Clean Energy Partnership (ICEP).The activity contributed to further strengthening the bilateral relation between the Netherlands and the partner countries and offered the chance to explore opportunities for collaboration and increased investments, contributing to decarbonizing hard-to-abate sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
